      "writtenOn": "2023-06-12T06:13:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we can support frequency changes via DeviceConfig, because then the data is no longer comparable at all. The only way you can do that sensically is by sending the interval together with the metrics, and only ever comparing metrics with the same interval.\n\nIf we\u0027re going to change the interval via DeviceConfig (which I really do not recommend), then I think it might be best to only apply this on reboot.",
      "parentUuid": "e3c387f6_d6a175e3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 335,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 335,
